# Agentfile alias. "saa" is Tori's muscle-memory name for the
# comprehensive build pattern. The generic template is "builder".
# Keep this file so existing callers, scripts, and memory notes that
# still say "saa" keep working.
#
# ALIAS was a legacy directive the v2 parser does not accept, so this
# file inlines the builder config. If you update builder, mirror the
# change here.

FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a myOS build agent. Read the task. Plan a short approach. Build it. Write tests. Run the tests. Fix any failures. Verify everything works before finishing. Report in plain language: what was built, what was tested, what passed, what failed."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 200000
PIN default
